{"kfs": [{"id": "kfS", "headword": "कृश्", "headword_slp1": "kfS", "fold": "kfs", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृश् vi. 4P (pres. कृश्यति) 1. To become lean, to become emaciated; 2. to wane (as the moon).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "kfz", "headword": "कृष्", "headword_slp1": "kfz", "fold": "kfs", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृष् (I) vt. 1P (pp. कृष्ट) 1. To draw, to drag, to pull, to tear, प्रसह्य सिंहः किल तां चकर्षR.ii.27; 2. to attract, Bg.xv.7; 3. to lead or conduct, as an army, e.g. स सेनां महतीं कर्षन् R.iv.32; 4. to bond (as a bow), नात्यायतकृष्टशार्ङ्गः R.v.50; 5. to become master of, to overpower, to subdue, बलवानिंद्रियग्रामो विद्वांसमपि कर्षति M.ii.215; 6. to plough, e.g. अनुलोमकृष्टं क्षेत्रं प्रतिलोमं कर्षति; 7. to obtain, e.g. कर्षति च महद्यशः.With अप-, 1. to draw back or away, to pull off, to take away, to drag away, दंतच्छदं प्रियतमेन निपीतसारं दंताग्रभिन्नमपकृष्य निरीक्षते च Rt.iv.14, R.xvi.55; 2. to lessen, to diminish.With अव-, to draw, to draw away from.With आ-, 1. to draw, to draw towards, to pull, to attract, दूरममुना सारंगेण वयमाकृष्टाः Sak.i., नाकस्माद् युवती वृद्धं केशेष्वाकृष्य चुंबति Hit.i., Am.S.72, K.S.ii.59, R.i.23; 2. to bend, as a bow, Sis.ix.40; 3. to snatch, to take by force, Bt.xvi.30; 4. to supply a word or words from a previous sentence.With उद्-, 1. to draw up, to pull up, to extricate, अंगदकोटिलग्नं प्रालंबमुत्कृष्य R.vi.14; 2. to enhance, to increase.With नि-, to sink down, to diminish.With निस्-, 1. to draw out, to pull out; 2. to exact, to snatch, to take by force, निष्क्रष्टुमर्थं चकमे कुबेरात् R.v.26.With परि-, to draw, to pull, to drag.With प्र-, 1. to draw away, to pull, to attract; 2. to lead, as an army; 3. to bend, as a bow.With वि-, 1. to draw, to pull; 2. to bend, as a bow, करासनं तेषु विकृष्यतामिदम् Sak.vi.With विप्र-, to remove.With संनि-, to make near.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "कृष् (II) vt. 6Ā (pp. कृष्ट) To make furrows, to plough.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kfsa": [{"id": "kfSa", "headword": "कृश", "headword_slp1": "kfSa", "fold": "kfsa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृश a. (f. शा; compar. क्रशीयस्; super. क्रशिष्ठ) 1. Lean, emaciated, weak, M.iv.184; 2. small, little, minute (in size or quantity), e.g. सुहृदपि न याच्यः कृशधनः Bhartr.ii.28; 3. poor, M.vii.208.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृशः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kfSaH"]}, {"id": "kfSA", "headword": "कृशा", "headword_slp1": "kfSA", "fold": "kfsa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृश a. (f. शा; compar. क्रशीयस्; super. क्रशिष्ठ) 1. Lean, emaciated, weak, M.iv.184; 2. small, little, minute (in size or quantity), e.g. सुहृदपि न याच्यः कृशधनः Bhartr.ii.28; 3. poor, M.vii.208.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kfsaksa": [{"id": "kfSAkza", "headword": "कृशाक्ष", "headword_slp1": "kfSAkza", "fold": "kfsaksa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृश-अक्ष m. a spider.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृशाक्षः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kfSAkzaH"]}], "kfsangi": [{"id": "kfSAMgI", "headword": "कृशांगी", "headword_slp1": "kfSAMgI", "fold": "kfsangi", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृश-अंगी f. 1. a woman with a slender frame; 2. the priyangu creeper.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["कृशाङ्गी"], "synonyms_slp1": ["kfSANgI"]}], "kfsodara": [{"id": "kfSodara", "headword": "कृशोदर", "headword_slp1": "kfSodara", "fold": "kfsodara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृश-उदर a. thin-waisted.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kfsala": [{"id": "kfSalA", "headword": "कृशला", "headword_slp1": "kfSalA", "fold": "kfsala", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "कृशला f. Hair.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "kfsanu": [{"id": "kfSAnu", "headword": "कृशानु", "headword_slp1": "kfSAnu", "fold": "kfsanu", "headword_lang